 : "候选改变了源文本受保护标识，系统将阻止写入。"}</p>
 {(suggestion.protected_token_issues || []).length > 0 && (
 <ul>
 {(suggestion.protected_token_issues || []).map((issue, issueIndex) => (
 <li key={`${suggestion.suggestion_id}-protected-${issueIndex}`}>
