 <label><input type="checkbox" checked={templateUpgradeApprovalResetAccepted} onChange={(event) => setTemplateUpgradeApprovalResetAccepted(event.target.checked)} /><span>我理解升级后的全部章节需按新结构重新确认并冻结，旧冻结记录不会自动继承。</span></label>
